    "title": "Man shot and killed on Rochester's west side - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WHAM ,\n3 hours ago Rochester, N.Y. — Police are investigating a homicide Wednesday night on the city's west side. Officers responded around 8:30 p.m. to North Plymouth Avenue near Lyell Avenue, where the victim, a man in his 30s, suffering from several gunshot wounds, according to Captain Frank Umbrino of the Rochester Police Department. He was rushed to Strong Memorial Hospital and died shortly after his arrival. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
